  "description": "* Note: This is a promotional oneshot.*  \nThe life of Jeong Eunjae, a terminally-ill patient, has ended. She didn't have any regrets about her life, however...\n\n[Allotted time: One year! Fine the 'real male lead' within the allotted time!]  \n\"Ho-Hold on! Hold on a minute! What is this?! What on earth is this?!\"\n\nI thought I died, but when I opened my eyes, I found myself in a strange world. What was even more shocking was that I have a healthy body now.\n\n[If you can't find 'the real male lead', you will die a year from now! It will be fun, right?]\n\nAs I saw this message, I looked at the green text above their head.\n\n[Affection level: 0%]\n\n[The affection level of the men you haven't met before, will start at 0%. Of course, there is an exception!]\n\n[If you cannot raise the affection levels, prepare to be bombarded with missions!]\n\nWhoa, it's really happening.\n\n\"He...llo?\"\n\nFor now, let's try to live.\n\nAmong you men, who is the real male lead?\n\n[Promotional Oneshot](https://page.kakao.com/content/63142297)",
